  "summaryOfChange": "Replaced the previous question about an alternating pattern in resonator_lab (day 10) with a new, data‑driven question focusing on the pronounced level shift in pendulum_lab around day 17. Introduced four explanatory hypotheses (temperature, mechanical relaxation, seismic vibration, data error) plus a residual category, allocating probabilities based on the strength of supporting and contradictory evidence. Updated probabilities reflect the higher plausibility of local instrumental factors given the lack of similar anomalies in pendulum_obs or resonator data."
}

